{"schemaVersion":"uapt-school-change-events-v2","revision":"qs51-70-v6-complete-r4-20261025","slug":"delft-university-of-technology","basisSha256":"6f6afd1f1534b12348bfbbfa9fd2118de1b10cb86f13fa099846cd1e66c69073","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","currentRecordSha256":"edfb5c55af7606d21c60e94ebd3c14735de6b578e1960d59db1d810f95f57d60","currentClaimIds":["cl-delft-university-of-technology-microsoft-copilot-263","delft-claim-001","delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-appeal","delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-course","delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-detect","delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-disclose","delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-exams","delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-integrity","delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-privacy","delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-research","delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-tools"],"themeOrder":["coursework","exams","disclosure","privacy_data","approved_tools","research_publication","academic_integrity","teaching_guidance","security_procurement"],"events":[{"id":"delft-university-of-technology:qs46-50-v6-r1-20261023","slug":"delft-university-of-technology","revision":"qs46-50-v6-r1-20261023","previousRevision":"public-release-20260924-002","publishedAt":"2026-10-23T21:18:10.827043Z","url":"/changes/qs46-50-v6-r1-20261023/delft-university-of-technology","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","items":[{"id":"claim:cl-delft-university-of-technology-microsoft-copilot-263","category":"tracker_correction","theme":"ai_tool_treatment","claimId":"cl-delft-university-of-technology-microsoft-copilot-263","matchMethod":"claim_id","oldText":"Microsoft Copilot (web) is listed for Delft University of Technology in an official university AI tools source. Derived availability: allowed. Derived endorsement type: officially endorsed.","newText":"The ME faculty recommends web Microsoft Copilot and states students can sign in with their TU Delft credentials; recommendation and access do not establish blanket task permission or an institution-wide endorsement.","comparison":"exact_claim_id","sourceUrls":["https://filelist.tudelft.nl/me/Organisatie/Generative%20AI%20Guidelines%20for%20Students%20%E2%80%93%20Faculty%20of%20Mechanical%20Engineering%C2%A02026%20Jan.pdf","https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/ai-in-education"]},{"id":"claim:delft-claim-001","category":"tracker_correction","theme":"ai_tool_treatment","claimId":"delft-claim-001","matchMethod":"claim_id","oldText":"TU Delft teaching guidance says Microsoft Copilot Chat, after login with NetID, is currently the only generative AI tool permitted for use at TU Delft for education.","newText":"TU Delft Teaching Support says NetID-authenticated Microsoft Copilot Chat is currently the only tool permitted for educational use; the institution-wide policy remains under development, and individual assessments are subject to their own rules.","comparison":"exact_claim_id","sourceUrls":["https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/ai-in-education"]},{"id":"claim:delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-appeal","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","themes":["academic_integrity"],"claimId":"delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-appeal","matchMethod":"none","newText":"An appealable examiner/Board decision can be challenged before CBE within six weeks starting the day after the decision was announced/sent. Pro-forma appeals and exceptional non-culpable lateness have separate conditions; check the actual decision and appealability.","sourceUrls":["https://www.tudelft.nl/en/student/my-study-me/rules-guidelines-and-participation/objections-and-appeals/appeals"]},{"id":"claim:delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-course","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"coursework","themes":["coursework"],"claimId":"delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-course","matchMethod":"none","newText":"ME guidance uses a “Yes, unless” rule of thumb for unsupervised work, subject to written course restrictions and the student’s own reasoning/writing responsibilities. Check the course statement; this is not a university-wide default or an exam permission.","sourceUrls":["https://filelist.tudelft.nl/me/Organisatie/Generative%20AI%20Guidelines%20for%20Students%20%E2%80%93%20Faculty%20of%20Mechanical%20Engineering%C2%A02026%20Jan.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-detect","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"teaching_guidance","themes":["teaching_guidance"],"claimId":"delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-detect","matchMethod":"none","newText":"Teaching Support warns that relying on AI detectors to penalise students risks false accusations; use appropriate authenticity checks and Board procedures. This is not a university ban on detectors.","sourceUrls":["https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/ai-in-education/ai-in-assessment/ai-detection-tools-usage"]},{"id":"claim:delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-disclose","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"disclosure","themes":["disclosure"],"claimId":"delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-disclose","matchMethod":"none","newText":"Where the ME instructor limits AI, students must disclose use for work contributing to a grade using the selected acknowledgement format. End/appendix placement is a recommendation and excluded from word count. Not acknowledging restricted use could be fraud, not automatically a finding.","sourceUrls":["https://filelist.tudelft.nl/me/Organisatie/Generative%20AI%20Guidelines%20for%20Students%20%E2%80%93%20Faculty%20of%20Mechanical%20Engineering%C2%A02026%20Jan.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-exams","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"exams","themes":["exams"],"claimId":"delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-exams","matchMethod":"none","newText":"ME2026/27 MSc Article7 treats examination aids not expressly permitted as fraud examples. Check the exact exam authorization; unsupervised coursework guidance does not authorize examination aids.","sourceUrls":["https://filelist.tudelft.nl/Studentenportal/Faculteitspecifiek/ME/Onderwijs/GERELATEERD/Reglementen/Archief%20Onderwijsreglementen/2026-2027/Confirmed%20RGBE%20MSc%20ME%202026-27.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-integrity","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","themes":["academic_integrity"],"claimId":"delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-integrity","matchMethod":"none","newText":"ME2026/27 BSc/MSc Article7 covers AI output presented as one’s own through deception, carelessness or inadequate referencing. The programme Board of Examiners handles suspected fraud; students can respond orally/in writing before a finding/sanction, except no hearing is required if no fraud is found. No result/annulment normally follows fraud, with exceptional cases; further sanctions are case-specific.","sourceUrls":["https://filelist.tudelft.nl/Studentenportal/Faculteitspecifiek/ME/Onderwijs/GERELATEERD/Reglementen/Archief%20Onderwijsreglementen/2026-2027/Confirmed%20RGBE%20MSc%20ME%202026-27.pdf","https://filelist.tudelft.nl/Studentenportal/Faculteitspecifiek/ME/Onderwijs/GERELATEERD/Reglementen/Archief%20Onderwijsreglementen/2026-2027/Vastgestelde%20RRvE%20BSc%20ME%202026-27.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-privacy","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"privacy_data","themes":["privacy_data","security_procurement"],"claimId":"delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-privacy","matchMethod":"none","newText":"Teaching guidance advises not sharing personal, internal or highly confidential information with AI. Tool log/retention and procurement approval are not established by that advice.","sourceUrls":["https://filelist.tudelft.nl/me/Organisatie/Generative%20AI%20Guidelines%20for%20Students%20%E2%80%93%20Faculty%20of%20Mechanical%20Engineering%C2%A02026%20Jan.pdf","https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/assess/guidelines/ai-chatbots-in-unsupervised-assessment"]},{"id":"claim:delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-research","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"research_publication","themes":["research_publication"],"claimId":"delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-research","matchMethod":"none","newText":"TU Delft OPEN Publishing requires disclosure of generative AI use within its publishing policy. Human-participant research needs HREC approval before engaging participants. These scopes do not establish every thesis/journal rule or assessment permission.","sourceUrls":["https://www.tudelft.nl/en/open-publishing/publish-with-us/resources-support/tu-delft-open-publishing-policies","https://www.tudelft.nl/research-support/planning-set-up/ethics-security-and-privacy"]},{"id":"claim:delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-tools","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"approved_tools","themes":["approved_tools"],"claimId":"delft-university-of-technology-local-20261023-tools","matchMethod":"none","newText":"Teaching Support currently identifies NetID Copilot Chat as the permitted educational GenAI service and says a university-wide policy is in development. ME recommends web Copilot with Delft credentials; service access does not authorize a specific task. Do not substitute AI for personal analysis.","sourceUrls":["https://filelist.tudelft.nl/me/Organisatie/Generative%20AI%20Guidelines%20for%20Students%20%E2%80%93%20Faculty%20of%20Mechanical%20Engineering%C2%A02026%20Jan.pdf","https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/ai-in-education"]},{"id":"source:https://filelist.tudelft.nl/Studentenportal/Faculteitspecifiek/ME/Onderwijs/GERELATEERD/Reglementen/Archief%20Onderwijsreglementen/2026-2027/Confirmed%20RGBE%20MSc%20ME%202026-27.pdf","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://filelist.tudelft.nl/Studentenportal/Faculteitspecifiek/ME/Onderwijs/GERELATEERD/Reglementen/Archief%20Onderwijsreglementen/2026-2027/Confirmed%20RGBE%20MSc%20ME%202026-27.pdf"]},{"id":"source:https://filelist.tudelft.nl/Studentenportal/Faculteitspecifiek/ME/Onderwijs/GERELATEERD/Reglementen/Archief%20Onderwijsreglementen/2026-2027/Vastgestelde%20RRvE%20BSc%20ME%202026-27.pdf","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://filelist.tudelft.nl/Studentenportal/Faculteitspecifiek/ME/Onderwijs/GERELATEERD/Reglementen/Archief%20Onderwijsreglementen/2026-2027/Vastgestelde%20RRvE%20BSc%20ME%202026-27.pdf"]},{"id":"source:https://www.tudelft.nl/en/open-publishing/publish-with-us/resources-support/tu-delft-open-publishing-policies","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://www.tudelft.nl/en/open-publishing/publish-with-us/resources-support/tu-delft-open-publishing-policies"]},{"id":"source:https://www.tudelft.nl/en/student/my-study-me/rules-guidelines-and-participation/objections-and-appeals/appeals","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://www.tudelft.nl/en/student/my-study-me/rules-guidelines-and-participation/objections-and-appeals/appeals"]},{"id":"source:https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/ai-in-education","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/ai-in-education"]},{"id":"source:https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/ai-in-education/ai-in-assessment/ai-detection-tools-usage","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"none","sourceUrls":["https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/ai-in-education/ai-in-assessment/ai-detection-tools-usage"]},{"id":"source:https://www.tudelft.nl/en/teaching-support/educational-advice/ai-in-education/ai-in-assessme